  "acceptanceMapping": {
    "pathPermissionAbi": "Blank root, missing required files, denied read, unreadable I/O, malformed PE and non-AMD64 game image each return their concrete fail-closed code; a valid AMD64 root still succeeds after injection.",
    "admission": "Missing selected root returns GAME_ROOT_NOT_FOUND, missing helper returns OVERVIEW_HELPER_MISSING, and a closed lifecycle returns GAME_OPERATION_CANCELLED. Missing-root/closed cases prove helper invocation count remains zero and no connected/PID state is fabricated.",
    "handshake": "Corrupt challenge hash, wrong helper-returned game path and changed critical current-client anchor each fail as LAUNCH_FAILED while external lifecycle status remains error/no PID. The same lifecycle then succeeds when the proofs are corrected.",
    "heartbeatTruth": "After a valid owned start, a stale heartbeat externally reports phase=error, connectionState=error, error=BRIDGE_DISCONNECTED while retaining the exact PID only for safe cleanup; it never reports connected.",
    "timeoutsCleanupRetry": "OverviewOfficialSettleChecks remains the bounded host regression: official recovery/settle failure, Lua-update retry, launcher game-spawn timeout retry, generic helper failure retry and post-helper readiness timeout exact cleanup + subsequent retry. The focused A08 command executes this regression too.",
    "transactionalStartup": "R7-090 A10 separately proves all 12 production-helper transaction failure stages restore/retain journals correctly, clean owned processes, and allow subsequent retry."
